  ('Which natural satellite orbits the Earth?', array['Mars','The Moon','The Sun','Venus'], 1, 'easy'),
  ('What causes the tides on Earth?', array['Wind patterns','The Moon''s gravitational pull','Ocean currents','Earth''s rotation'], 1, 'medium'),
  ('What is the name for the imaginary line around which the Earth spins?', array['The equator','The axis','The meridian','The horizon'], 1, 'medium'),
  ('Which continent is home to the most species of big cats?', array['Asia','Africa','South America','Australia'], 1, 'medium'),
